sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Requester (Slack)
    participant S as Slack Workflow
    participant L as Slack List
    participant A as Asana
    participant V as ATS / GVP (Slack)
    participant T as TES team (Asana)
    participant F as AgentForge
    participant B as POC Gateway Bot

    U->>S: Submit SAF POC Request form
    S->>U: Intake message in #saf-poc-requests (thread root)
    S->>A: Create task (description with Slack Thread TS)
    S->>L: Add item to POC Request Tracker
    A->>A: Initialize Work Request, parser script
    S->>V: Thread reply to ATS: Approve / Reject
    V->>S: ATS clicks Approve
    S->>A: Move to Pending GVP Approval, comment
    S->>L: Update ATS status
    S->>V: Thread reply to GVP: Approve / Decline
    V->>S: GVP clicks Approve
    S->>A: Move to Agreement Validation, comment
    S->>U: Thread reply: confirm MNDA
    U->>S: Clicks Confirmed
    S->>A: Move to Ready for TES, comment
    S->>U: Thread reply: Stage 4 Ready for TES
    A->>A: Sync Status with Board Lane (POC Status, task type status)
    T->>A: Move to Active Provisioning
    A-->>F: Signed webhook event
    F->>A: Read task (status, Customer, Slack Thread TS)
    F->>B: Post status update with thread_ts
    B->>U: Reply in the original thread
    F->>F: Write outcome to page log
    T->>A: Move to Implemented / Live, then Completed
    A-->>F: Signed webhook event (each move)
    F->>B: Post reply (de-duplicated per task and stage, 60 s)
    B->>U: Reply in the original thread
